msgid "Tutorial closed. Input remains stopped; select WASD control or toggle Run mode when ready."
msgstr "教程已关闭，输入仍已停止。准备好后，请重新选择 WASD 操控或切换运行模式。"

msgid "Start with a robot"
msgstr "从机器人示例开始"

msgid "Close this guide to try each step, then reopen the book icon to continue. Your place is kept until the app closes.\n\nIn the left library, choose Answer: biped for movement, or Answer: servo arm for a simple coding example. Loading a starter replaces the current assembly and code."
msgstr "阅读每一步后关闭教程进行尝试，再点击书本图标即可继续。关闭应用前会保留当前步骤。\n\n在左侧库中，选择“示例：双足机器人”体验移动，或选择“示例：舵机机械臂”练习简单编程。加载示例会替换当前装配和代码。"

msgid "Look around: middle mouse to orbit, Shift + middle mouse to pan, wheel to zoom."
msgstr "观察视图：鼠标中键旋转，Shift + 中键平移，滚轮缩放。"

msgid "Add and connect parts"
msgstr "添加并连接零件"

msgid "In edit mode, search the Parts library or use its category filter, then click a part to add it. Select it in the 3D view and press G to move it near a compatible yellow port. Confirm to snap.\n\nMechanical connections hold parts together. Electrical connections map servos to board pins; code must use the pins actually wired in your robot."
msgstr "在编辑模式中搜索零件库或按分类筛选，然后点击零件添加。在 3D 视图中选中零件，按 G 将其移到兼容的黄色端口附近，确认后吸附连接。\n\n机械连接用于固定零件。电气连接将舵机映射到开发板引脚；代码必须使用机器人实际接线的引脚。"

msgid "Ctrl + Z undoes an addition, deletion or transform. Selection alone does not disconnect parts."
msgstr "Ctrl + Z 撤销添加、删除或变换。仅选中零件不会断开连接。"

msgid "Edit with familiar shortcuts"
msgstr "使用熟悉的快捷键编辑"

msgid "Select a part, then press G to move or R to rotate. Press X, Y or Z to constrain the world axis. Type a distance in millimetres or an angle in degrees.\n\nTry G, X, 10, Enter to move 10 mm. Enter confirms; Esc cancels and restores connections. This is object editing, not Blender mesh or vertex editing."
msgstr "选中零件后，按 G 移动或 R 旋转。按 X、Y 或 Z 限制世界坐标轴。距离以毫米输入，角度以度输入。\n\n依次按 G、X、10、Enter 可移动 10 mm。Enter 确认；Esc 取消并恢复连接。这是对象编辑，不是 Blender 的网格或顶点编辑。"

msgid "Use Frame robot to fit the view. Part scaling is not supported; the vertical axis is Y."
msgstr "使用“聚焦机器人”让视图适合机器人。不支持缩放零件；竖直轴为 Y。"

msgid "Drive with WASD"
msgstr "使用 WASD 操控"

msgid "Load the biped example, choose Control: WASD / gamepad movement on the right, then enable Run mode at the top. Click the 3D view before driving.\n\nW / S moves forward / backward; A / D turns. A gamepad's left stick sends the same commands. Space brakes; Esc or Stop disables input. The experimental biped gait can be slow or drift; other robots need their own joint program."
msgstr "加载双足机器人示例，在右侧选择 WASD / 手柄移动操控，再开启顶部的运行模式。操控前先点击 3D 视图。\n\nW / S 前进或后退；A / D 转向。手柄左摇杆发送相同指令。Space 制动；Esc 或停止按钮禁用输入。实验性双足步态可能较慢或偏航；其他机器人需要各自的关节程序。"

msgid "Opening this guide stops code and movement input, not physics. After closing, select WASD control again or toggle Run mode to resume."
msgstr "打开教程会停止代码和移动输入，但不会暂停物理。关闭后，重新选择 WASD 操控或切换运行模式即可恢复操控。"

msgid "Run your own servo code"
msgstr "运行自己的舵机代码"

msgid "For a first code exercise, load the servo arm example and inspect its program in the Code tab. Run code enables physics and gives your program control of the wired servos.\n\nCode and WASD never drive the robot at the same time. Typing in an editor does not move the robot. Stop cancels the program; return to edit mode to restore the assembled pose."
msgstr "首次编程练习可加载舵机机械臂示例，在代码页查看程序。运行代码会开启物理，并让程序控制已接线的舵机。\n\n代码和 WASD 不会同时操控机器人。在编辑器中打字不会移动机器人。停止会取消程序；返回编辑模式可恢复装配姿态。"

msgid "The editor supports a small Python-style servo language, not the full Python runtime. Loading an example replaces your current code."
msgstr "编辑器支持精简的 Python 风格舵机语言，而非完整 Python 运行时。加载示例会替换当前代码。"

msgid "Explore the AI motion lab"
msgstr "探索 AI 动作实验室"

msgid "Open AI motion lab: Connect checks the optional external bridge; Search sets a goal and trial count; Results compares measured trials. Start with the bridge's mock mode without paid model calls.\n\nLive GPT calls require a server-side API key, model access and explicit paid consent. This searches bounded gait parameters, not model training. Apply a valid best result only in edit mode with the same robot assembly."
msgstr "打开 AI 动作实验室：连接页检查可选的外部桥接服务；搜索页设置目标和试验次数；结果页比较实测数据。可先使用桥接服务的 mock 模式，不调用付费模型。\n\n真实 GPT 调用需要服务器端 API 密钥、模型访问权限及明确的付费同意。这是有限范围内的步态参数搜索，不是模型训练。仅在编辑模式下、机器人装配未改变时，才能应用有效的最佳结果。"

msgid "This guide never connects to a service, starts a trial or grants paid consent. Close it when you are ready to explore."
msgstr "本教程不会连接服务、启动试验或授予付费同意。准备好后，关闭教程自行探索。"

