msgstr "示例：人形机器人（实验）"

msgid "Humanoid loaded. W/S walk, Shift sprint trial, E pick up or release. A/D turning is not supported yet."
msgstr "已加载人形机器人。W/S 行走，Shift 试跑，E 抓取或释放。暂不支持 A/D 转向。"

msgid "AI search currently supports only the four-servo biped, not the humanoid."
msgstr "AI 搜索目前仅支持四舵机双足机器人，暂不支持人形机器人。"

msgid "Humanoid physics prototype\nW/S: walk · Shift: sprint trial\nE: pick up / release · Space: brake\nA/D turning is not supported yet.\nStop or opening a guide releases the box.\nAI search is not available for this robot."
msgstr "人形物理原型\nW/S：行走 · Shift：试跑\nE：抓取 / 释放 · Space：制动\n暂不支持 A/D 转向。\n停止或打开指南会释放箱子。\n此机器人暂不支持 AI 搜索。"

msgid "Try the physics humanoid"
msgstr "体验物理人形机器人"

msgid "Choose Answer: humanoid (experimental), enable Run mode and click the 3D view. W/S walks; hold Shift for a sprint trial. Gamepad B requests sprint and X interacts. A/D turning is not supported yet.\n\nStand close to the box and press E. The robot crouches, reaches with both arms and grips only after both hands contact the box. Press E again to release it under gravity."
msgstr "选择“示例：人形机器人（实验）”，开启运行模式并点击 3D 视图。W/S 行走，按住 Shift 试跑。手柄 B 请求试跑，X 进行交互。暂不支持 A/D 转向。\n\n站在箱子附近按 E。机器人会下蹲并伸出双臂，只有双手都接触箱子后才会抓握。再次按 E 释放，箱子会在重力作用下落下。"

msgid "This is a simplified ten-joint physics prototype, not trained human motion. Sprinting is not stable yet and can fall. Stop, code control or opening this guide releases the box. Reset in edit mode after a fall. AI search still supports only the four-servo biped."
msgstr "这是简化的十关节物理原型，并非学习了人类动作的模型。试跑尚不稳定，可能跌倒。停止、切换代码控制或打开本指南都会释放箱子。跌倒后请在编辑模式中重置。AI 搜索仍仅支持四舵机双足机器人。"

msgid "Humanoid needs all ten joints and unambiguous wiring. Reload the humanoid preset to reset."
msgstr "人形机器人需要完整的 10 个关节及无歧义接线。请重新载入人形示例以重置。"

msgid "Pickup learning lab"
msgstr "拾箱学习实验室"

