msgstr "轮数"

msgid "Start pickup search"
msgstr "开始拾箱搜索"

msgid "Each round tests four candidates. Change parallelism while running (1–4); fewer lanes drain existing trials. More lanes need more CPU/GPU, not more API calls per round."
msgstr "每轮测试 4 个候选方案。运行时可将并行数调为 1–4；减少时会等待已有实验完成。更多并行实验会增加 CPU/GPU 负载，但不会增加每轮 API 调用数。"

