msgid "Saved scenarios include the exact assembly, bounded policy and recorded metrics, not credentials or prompts. Loading does not prove success; replay to verify again."
msgstr "场景保存完整装配结构、限定范围的动作参数和测量记录，不保存凭据或提示词。加载不代表验证成功，请重新运行物理实验。"

