msgstr "示例：拼装套件类人机器人"

msgid "Answer: kit bridge"
msgstr "示例：套件桥梁"

msgid "Construction kit"
msgstr "拼装套件"

msgid "Construction-kit humanoid loaded. Each beam, plate, bracket and connector is a separate part. Select a part to inspect its holes; G moves it."
msgstr "已加载拼装套件类人机器人。每根梁、板、支架和连接件都是独立零件。选中零件可查看孔位，按 G 移动。"

msgid "Kit bridge loaded: the same beams, plates and fasteners, assembled into a different structure."
msgstr "已加载套件桥梁：用相同的梁、板和紧固件拼装成不同的结构。"

msgid "Build with interchangeable parts"
msgstr "用可互换的零件拼装"

msgid "Choose Answer: construction-kit humanoid, then open AI motion lab. Start locally or connect Luna, increase parallel trials from 1 to 4, select a measured result and save it. Saved scenarios must be replayed before applying; paid API calls need explicit consent."
msgstr "选择“示例：拼装套件类人机器人”，然后打开 AI 动作实验室。本地开始或连接 Luna，将并行实验数从 1 增加到 4，选择测量结果并保存。保存的场景须重新运行后才能应用；付费 API 调用需要明确同意。"

msgid "Choose Answer: construction-kit humanoid or Answer: kit bridge. Both use the same 20 mm-pitch beams, plates, brackets and connectors. Select one part, move it with G and snap a matching hole to another part. The Blender file includes a parts tray, assembled examples and an exploded view; no torso or limb is one joined frame."
msgstr "选择“示例：拼装套件类人机器人”或“示例：套件桥梁”。两者都使用相同的 20 mm 孔距梁、板、支架和连接件。选中一个零件，按 G 移动，将兼容的孔位吸附到另一个零件。Blender 文件包含零件托盘、拼装示例和爆炸图；躯干与四肢都不是合并成一体的框架。"

msgid "The kit uses ssok's own virtual dimensions, not a certified commercial standard. Motors are complete units; structural beams, plates and covers remain separate."
msgstr "本套件采用 ssok 自定义的虚拟尺寸，并非经过认证的商业标准。电机是完整单元；结构梁、板和盖板均保持独立。"

msgid "Projects"
msgstr "项目"

msgid "Keep building. Pick up where you left off."
msgstr "保存作品，随时继续搭建。"

msgid "Saved on this device. Export a copy before clearing browser data or changing devices."
msgstr "保存在此设备上。清除浏览器数据或更换设备前，请导出副本。"

msgid "Project name"
msgstr "项目名称"

msgid "Save a snapshot"
msgstr "保存快照"

msgid "Export project"
msgstr "导出项目"

msgid "Saved projects"
msgstr "已保存的项目"

msgid "Open selected"
msgstr "打开所选项目"

msgid "Delete snapshot"
msgstr "删除快照"

msgid "Import / export"
msgstr "导入 / 导出"

msgid "Copy this project JSON to share it, or paste a project here to import. Imported code never runs automatically."
msgstr "复制项目 JSON 以分享，或在此粘贴项目以导入。导入的代码不会自动运行。"

msgid "Copy JSON"
msgstr "复制 JSON"

msgid "Project JSON copied."
msgstr "已复制项目 JSON。"

msgid "Import project"
msgstr "导入项目"

msgid "Confirm project action"
msgstr "确认项目操作"

msgid "Save creates a new snapshot; earlier versions are kept."
msgstr "每次保存都会创建新快照，早期版本将保留。"

msgid "Project saved. Your previous snapshots are still available."
msgstr "项目已保存。以前的快照仍可使用。"

msgid "Project data is invalid or too large."
msgstr "项目数据无效或过大。"

msgid "Your project library is full. Export or delete a saved project first."
msgstr "项目库已满。请先导出或删除一个已保存的项目。"

msgid "Could not save this project. Export a copy to keep your work."
msgstr "无法保存项目。请导出副本以保留作品。"

msgid "Project JSON is ready. Keep a copy outside this device."
msgstr "项目 JSON 已就绪。请在此设备之外保存一份副本。"

msgid "This is not a valid ssok project. Your current work is unchanged."
msgstr "这不是有效的 ssok 项目。当前作品未更改。"

msgid "Replace the current assembly and code? Save a snapshot first if you want to keep them."
msgstr "替换当前装配和代码？如需保留，请先保存快照。"

msgid "Delete this saved snapshot? Other snapshots and your open project are kept."
msgstr "删除此快照？其他快照和当前项目将保留。"

msgid "Snapshot deleted."
msgstr "快照已删除。"

msgid "Could not delete this snapshot."
msgstr "无法删除此快照。"

msgid "Project opened. Code runs only when you press Run code."
msgstr "项目已打开。仅在点击运行代码后执行。"

msgid "Blocks"
msgstr "积木"

msgid "Connect servo"
msgstr "连接舵机"

msgid "Set servo angle"
msgstr "设置舵机角度"

msgid "Set relative angle"
msgstr "设置相对角度"

msgid "Wait"
msgstr "等待"

msgid "Virtual servo board"
msgstr "虚拟舵机控制板"

msgid "Build a program with blocks"
msgstr "用积木编写程序"

msgid "Read from code"
msgstr "从代码读取"

msgid "Add block"
msgstr "添加积木"

msgid "Apply blocks to code"
msgstr "将积木应用到代码"

msgid "Remove block"
msgstr "删除积木"

msgid "name"
msgstr "名称"

msgid "pin"
msgstr "引脚"

msgid "angle"
msgstr "角度"

msgid "seconds"
msgstr "秒"

msgid "This program is too large for the block editor."
msgstr "此程序超出了积木编辑器的大小限制。"

msgid "This line cannot be represented as a block. Your code is unchanged."
msgstr "此行无法表示为积木。代码未更改。"

msgid "This command is outside the board API limits. Your code is unchanged."
msgstr "此命令超出了控制板 API 的范围。代码未更改。"

msgid "A block contains an invalid value. Your code is unchanged."
msgstr "积木中有无效值。代码未更改。"

msgid "Blocks are ready. Apply them to update the code; Run code starts the robot."
msgstr "积木已就绪。应用后可更新代码，点击运行代码启动机器人。"

msgid "Code updated. Run code to try your program."
msgstr "代码已更新。运行代码来试试程序。"

msgid "Code changed after these blocks were loaded. Read from code before applying."
msgstr "读取积木后代码已更改。请重新从代码读取后再应用。"

msgid "Load an example"
msgstr "加载示例"

msgid "No saved projects yet. Save your first snapshot above."
msgstr "还没有保存的项目。请在上方保存第一个快照。"

msgid "Keep your changes?"
msgstr "保留更改吗？"

msgid "This example will replace your assembly and code. Save a snapshot to keep your changes."
msgstr "此示例将替换当前装配和代码。保存快照可保留更改。"

msgid "Replace without saving"
msgstr "不保存并替换"

msgid "Save and switch"
msgstr "保存并切换"

msgid "Replace unapplied blocks with the current code?"
msgstr "用当前代码替换尚未应用的积木吗？"

msgid "Resolve the block editor error before saving or exporting. Your changes are kept."
msgstr "请先解决积木编辑器中的错误，再保存或导出。您的更改会保留。"

msgid "Saving or exporting applies valid blocks to your code."
msgstr "保存或导出时会将有效积木应用到代码。"

msgid "Esc leaves the code editor. Tab moves between controls."
msgstr "按 Esc 离开代码编辑器，按 Tab 在控件间移动。"

msgid "Build a program from blocks"
msgstr "用积木构建程序"

msgid "Open Blocks and choose Read from code. Change an angle or add a Wait block, then Apply blocks to code. Run code starts the robot; applying blocks never starts it automatically.\n\nSaving or exporting also includes valid unapplied blocks. If code and blocks were edited independently, resolve the conflict before saving. Unsupported code is kept intact."
msgstr "打开积木并选择从代码读取。修改角度或添加等待积木，然后应用到代码。点击运行代码才会启动机器人，应用积木不会自动运行。\n\n保存或导出也会包含尚未应用的有效积木。如果分别修改了代码和积木，请先解决冲突再保存。不支持的代码会保持原样。"

msgid "Use Tab and Shift + Tab to move between controls. Esc leaves the code editor and closes dialogs. Robot controls pause while a UI control has focus."
msgstr "使用 Tab 和 Shift + Tab 在控件间移动。Esc 可离开代码编辑器或关闭对话框。界面控件获得焦点时，机器人控制会暂停。"

msgid "Save and share your robot"
msgstr "保存并分享机器人"

msgid "Open Projects or press Ctrl / Cmd + S. Name your robot and choose Save a snapshot. Each save keeps earlier versions. Select a saved project and Open selected to restore its assembly and code without running it.\n\nExport project gives you portable JSON; the browser downloads a file. To open a shared project, paste its JSON in Import / export and choose Import project, then confirm replacement."
msgstr "打开项目或按 Ctrl / Cmd + S。为机器人命名并保存快照。每次保存都会保留旧版本。选择已保存的项目并打开，即可恢复装配和代码，且不会自动运行。\n\n导出项目可获得可移植的 JSON，浏览器会下载文件。要打开分享的项目，请将 JSON 粘贴到导入/导出，选择导入项目并确认替换。"

msgid "Projects are stored on this device. Keep an exported copy before clearing browser data or changing computers. Loading a starter asks before replacing unsaved work."
msgstr "项目保存在当前设备上。清除浏览器数据或更换电脑前，请保留导出的副本。加载示例会在替换未保存的工作前询问。"

msgid "Yaw Biped Body"
msgstr "偏航双足机身"

msgid "Yaw Leg Link"
msgstr "偏航腿部连杆"

msgid "Torque Micro Servo"
msgstr "限扭微型舵机"

msgid "Sixteen-channel controller"
msgstr "十六通道控制器"

msgid "Answer: learned biped"
msgstr "示例：学习步态机器人"

msgid "Learned biped loaded. Choose Run mode, then hold W to walk forward."
msgstr "已加载学习步态的双足机器人。进入运行模式，按住 W 向前行走。"

msgid "Learned forward gait: hold W or push the stick forward; release to stop. Reverse and turning are not supported."
msgstr "学习到的前进步态：按住 W 或向前推动摇杆，松开即停止。不支持后退和转向。"

msgid "This learned gait needs its original assembly and physics settings. Reload the learned-biped example to restore them."
msgstr "此学习步态需要原始装配和物理设置。请重新加载已学习步态的双足机器人示例以恢复。"
